{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/fca39736437a406aee0dd604e5e4549a.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1148 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/d72e348fd32a340544da4ed789cfbd06.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick your choices to boost your stats!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend a training ticket to pick one of three randomly presented training options and strengthen your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don\u2019t like the options, you can pay gold to refresh the training.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your stats, certain weapon types and combat styles become more effective. Create your own unique fighting style!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/7cdf0891569101967efbf35ae87f2fea.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1148 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/b92907e42f44d1c685512c06f7a6dfc6.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect gear and build your setup!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies that match your level to craft equipment that suits you,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or take down powerful visitors in the Colosseum to collect even stronger weapons, gloves, and titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons, gloves, and titles to create an efficient build of your own.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/5d2f755e5dd1ef488b66704a064d6fc3.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1148 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/3b7790882a862fbd86227e9f4da36aed.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Thrilling Victory Forged by Strategy and Luck!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit each enemy\u2019s unique weakness to deal massive damage,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or combine gear with powerful synergy to claim an overwhelming victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodges, guards, and critical hits are all left to chance\u2014will the goddess of luck smile upon you today?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/459898c2b55831870abe7a8223e23197.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1148 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062280/extras/a828b0e02b4c0d7ca10678d63086e61e.avif?t=1760853757\" width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy village life and build meaningful connections!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_p